@0    = ~No, no, no. You can totally train a cat to walk on a leash. I saw them in Luskan, these massive great fluffballs on leads.~
@1    = ~No. I'm sorry, but I don't believe you.~
@2    = ~Oh, come on, am I that untrustworthy? I can do puppy-eyes and everything. Look!~
@3    = ~Ha! That's ridiculous. You look like you've got a squint.~
@4    = ~Oh, Nathaniel, if you only knew the wonders that exist in the world, you wouldn't be so suspicious.~
@5    = ~I think it's your strange stories that make me suspicious, not my lack of experience.~
@6    = ~Okay. Tell me about Baldur's Gate - some story that'll make my hair stand on end.~
@7    = ~I hardly think that's likely. But - all right, there are these rumours about the temple of Umberlee...~
